  <item>
    <title>哔哔叭叭Vol.09丨一些关于《原则》的没有原则的对话（下）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66783fa2d3fc5dd627798a28</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66783fa2d3fc5dd627798a28</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 23 Jun 2024 15:30:41 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>关于一些勤劳的更新是来源于无法删减的废话，本期是两位主播聊《原则》的下期。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在下期中我们以傅梁为主线聊了一些有的没的。依然没有原则，依然很主观很生猛，希望大家可以喜欢，也欢迎大家和我们一起探讨。我们一直坚信，人类因思考而伟大，世界因不同而美妙。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="148">2:28</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;对文仔的毫无原则夸夸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="229">3:49</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;温嘉文，一枚标准的好学生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="855">14:15</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;罗嘉文，一个香香的白切黑切白</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="912">15:12</a> &nbsp;《他没过过笨人的日子》，主播又在找骂了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1220">20:20</a> &nbsp;唠不完的蔡霖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1512">25:12</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;关于为了吃醋包了一桌饺子，这个世界对傅鸣真的误解好像太深了点QAQ</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1710">28:30</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;小K姐又在批评我了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2152">35:52</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;少年人绝望之处的拥抱真伟大啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2694">44:54</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;你高中的时候不说脏话吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3049">50:49</a> &nbsp;《原则》全剧中的性别倒置</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3269">54:29</a> &nbsp;傅鸣真是怎么考上的知衡？？？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3514">58:34</a> &nbsp;汗流浃背了啊！兄弟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4113">1:08:33</a> 《傅鸣真之冤》（标题党了dbq）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4521">1:15:21</a> &nbsp;隔空喊话，我们想看温馨！我们想看双姝！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4672">1:17:52</a> &nbsp;大代特代，在工作中你是谁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4813">1:20:13</a> &nbsp;梁嘉文，一个温室中的理想主义者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5036">1:23:56</a> &nbsp;作为7d人，我们怎么可能忘了在剧里挖糖吃呢！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lr07WJ873n9j6cVW2c6bb6wK2HEQ.m4a" length="88806420" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:36:59</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoDUcAQhHlZ0STwibjIzu7hpO0DK.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>哔哔叭叭Vol.08丨一些关于《原则》的没有原则的对话</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6672faf4c26e396a36fb4b52</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6672faf4c26e396a36fb4b52</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 19 Jun 2024 15:36:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>不定期更新的主播又耐不住寂寞哔哔叭叭叨叨了起来。今天聊的是话剧九人在今年5月开始巡演的新剧，改编自香港话剧团原版的《原则》。由于实在废话太多又不舍删减，我们分成了上下集。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="170">02:50</a> &nbsp;《原则》是一部什么样的剧？九人自来水甚至情不自禁地想要帮剧团卖一卖票。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> &nbsp;《原则》为什么口碑几乎一边倒。甚至从此聊开来了一些主播当时毫无察觉的欠抽言论。（先跪下道歉）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="645">10:45</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;给出结局是戏剧的义务吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="890">14:50</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;自来水不是无脑吹，溺爱不是爱！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1470">24:30</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;问题出在粤译普吗？好像也不尽然。比如《最后的晚餐》。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;果然还是扯远了，怎么开始探讨上班儿了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2330">38:50</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;辣评知衡第一癫公，他是个聪明人还是个笨蛋？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2590">43:10</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;主播大翻车事件！</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrRheleSJFbwmTXd7W3RW5F_-N9l.m4a" length="48071238" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:52:46</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoDUcAQhHlZ0STwibjIzu7hpO0DK.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>哔哔叭叭叨叨Vol. 07 | Once 同人女，never went back——想象力可真了不起</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/665006c1c59d1e5757551ff3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">665006c1c59d1e5757551ff3</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 24 May 2024 03:17:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>不定期更新主播们营业了！这期我们聊聊“同人”</span></p><span></span><p><span>你将听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="147">02:27</a> 同人同人同人，到底啥是同人啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="268">04:28</a> 是谁中考作文在写同人故事？天呐，全是时代的眼泪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1024">17:04</a> 为什么会开始创作同人？嗯哼，我手写我心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2166">36:06</a> 当我们在搞同人的时候，到底在搞什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2510">41:50</a> 同人和抄袭之间的边界在哪里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2992">49:52</a> HE和BE，你选哪边</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3615">60:15</a> 同人创作的一些奇怪“圈规”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4277">71:17</a> 同人创作可以是严肃文学吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4861">81:01</a> 热门同人圈大盘点！你搞过几个？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5449">90:49</a> 同人文学是一种生存基本需求吗？对我们来说是的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5611">93:31</a> 搞同人的乐子事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6114">101:54</a> 很喜欢的作品但没有为之产出同人，为啥捏</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎和我们一起大磕特磕！</span></p><span></span><p><span>--------------------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>附录：提及的CP及作品</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 话剧九人作品：《春逝》、《对称性破缺》（顾静薇x瞿健雄），《双枰记》（郎世飖x卢泊安），《原则》（傅鸣真x梁嘉文/7D）</span></p><span></span><p><span>- H.O.T, JTL, Super junior，东方神起/豆花</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 《名侦探柯南》新一x毛利兰，柯南x灰原哀</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 《哈利·波特》</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 魔兽世界</span></p><span></span><p><span>- EC、楼诚、镇魂/巍澜、声入人心、bjyx、棋魂、山河令、偶像练习生+创造营+青春有你2&amp;3、一年一度喜剧大赛、名侦探学院</span></p><span></span><p><span>- POI 疑犯追踪</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 老友记</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 《年会不能停》徐云峰x马杰</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpWRRN0prgtYib26aG_bQA0g851k.m4a" length="106163189" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:49:18</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqesWnwN8b23psbnIpbH4L0VDxoC.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>哔哔叭叭Vol. 06 | 我们的赛博家庭聚会了！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/660bf492c963c27662671c55</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">660bf492c963c27662671c55</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 02 Apr 2024 12:05:37 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>锵锵~小糊播客诈尸更新了！</span></p><p><span>又是音质极其嘈杂的一期，准备作为本档播客的特色了（不是</span></p><p><strong><span>本期主播：</span></strong></p><p><span>@罐子 @K</span></p><p><strong><span>重磅嘉宾：</span></strong></p><p><span>@淳妹，aka清华毕业生、美国博士在读</span></p><p><span>@三三，aka只要去得勤，怎么不算薅环球影城的羊毛呢</span></p><p><span>@大树/小林，aka拥有6颗钢钉的新神榜敖丙不知名coser</span></p><p><span>---------------</span></p><p><span>本期你将听到：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="107">01:47</a> 终于聚齐了！我的赛博家庭！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="136">02:16</a> 带清华人看北大人的话剧，被cue做“绿化带”是怎样一种体验？</span></p><p><span>淳妹：“我以为是来看剧，怎么变成了是上班”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="982">16:22</a> 丸了呀，卢泊安你也有今天！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1326">22:06</a> 怎么就从戏剧聊到了family issue？</span></p><p><span>“家长怎么跟孩子沟通，对于孩子整个的世界观很重要”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3140">52:20</a> 真诚和勇敢，难道不是一句美好的祝愿吗？竟然有人不同意</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3529">58:49</a> 然后就延展成了P/J大探讨</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4810">80:10</a> 从“为什么要开这个播客”发散开去</span></p><p><span>（是的我们很爱哔哔但我们并不在乎有谁要听我们哔哔</span></p><p><span>--------------</span></p><p><span>最后</span></p><p><span>感谢我的赛博家人们！</span></p><p><span>友谊地久天长！</span></p>]]></description>
