  <item>
    <title>哔哔叭叭叨叨Vol.03 | 乌尔善，你是懂铜仁女的</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/652a4aea36a1383a665393f8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">652a4aea36a1383a665393f8</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 14 Oct 2023 08:01:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>是什么，让话痨但拖延星人们忽然努力</span></p><span></span><p><span>是怕再不发，就发不出来了（x</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期我们请到了知名磕学家@阿姒 来一起聊一聊三个月前看完的电影《封神》</span></p><span></span><p><span>评价极其主观，文化一点儿没有</span></p><span></span><p><span>但又怎样呢？欢迎在评论区和我们一起大放厥词</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期你将听到：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="204">03:24</a> 惊，封神原是合家欢大电影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="769">12:49</a> 磕cp到底是在磕什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="906">15:06</a> 封神，好看又难看（这段很长</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>虽然也可以只贪图美色</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1065">17:45</a> 但我们还是对剧情很有要求</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1797">29:57</a> 摇摆混乱的视角，和被削弱的主角悲剧性</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2318">38:38</a> 本应该更有魅力但变成工具人的角色：崇应彪+伯邑考</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3299">54:59</a> 妲己是否可以是个恋爱脑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3702">61:42</a> 费翔，天选in show</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3997">66:37</a> 对第二、三部的期待&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢收听！</span></p>]]></description>
