    <title>哔哔叭叭Vol.01 | 除去九人，还剩九人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6497d202a5b2b405c6a37de6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6497d202a5b2b405c6a37de6</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 25 Jun 2023 05:34:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，</span></p><span></span><p><span>这里是</span><strong><span>哔哔叨叨且叭叭</span></strong><span>的第一期节目</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播@罐子 @小K</span></strong><span>，两个屁话很多的普通人</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这里，</span></p><span></span><p><span>你可以听到我们聊话剧音乐剧/影视/综艺/CP/时事</span></p><span></span><p><span>总之就是聊这个世界！</span></p><span></span><p><span>聊我们对所有事情的意见！</span></p><span></span><p><span>虽然没有人在乎但我们就是要哔哔叭叭！</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎和我们一起大放厥词！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目是我们正式录制的第一期，</span></p><span></span><p><span>当然要聊我们最喜欢的话剧出品方：</span><strong><span>九人</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>但由于设备欠缺&amp;经验不足，选在了一个环境嘈杂的咖啡馆进行</span></p><span></span><p><span>（救，效果甚至不如我们在地铁站外头那次预录制</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以，除了以下↓内容外，</span></p><span></span><p><span>你还将听到各种杂音及信号干扰带来的噪音，在此先滑轨致歉</span></p><span></span><p><span>更多九人的剧目介绍和演出资讯，</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>请关注他们的官方双微@话剧九人</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="61">01:01</a> 个人的九人观剧史回顾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="397">06:37</a> 四张机1.0 vs 2.0：马水仙，谜一样的女子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="699">11:39</a> 卢泊安48，谁是你的one pick</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1133">18:53</a> 陈慧茹：一个让机枰两部剧都变更好看的女人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1462">24:22</a> 求三野：九人宇宙新晋人气王</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1591">26:31</a> 隋泓斐：nili清华人就是爱溜达</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1837">30:37</a> 笑死，两个非北大毕业生大谈北大精神</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2026">33:46</a> 串台1919：这部电影可真难看</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2315">38:35</a> 郎世飖人气评选滑铁卢！他能否靠庭前翻身？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2645">44:05</a> 凤毛麟角的民国女性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2930">48:50</a> 枰完的机真的很多刀（剧透警告</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3415">56:55</a> 话剧九人，了不起的小作坊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4404">73:24</a> 惯例呼唤春逝音乐剧和庭前（含一些选角口嗨</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>重要说明：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期节目所有观点均只代表两位主播本人立场，请勿上升至话剧九人任何工作人员。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>下期再见！</span></p>]]></description>
